%h1 Track categories

%p.mb-24
  This shows each track's category, read from the topics on its GitHub repo.
  The meaning of the categories is explained in #{link_to 'this forum post', 'http://forum.exercism.org/t/maintained-vs-single-maintained-vs-unmaintained-tracks/12636'}.

%table.c-admin-table
  %thead
    %tr
      %th Track
      %th Category
  %tbody
    - @track_categories.each do |track, category|
      %tr
        %td #{link_to track.title, Exercism::Routes.track_url(track)} (#{link_to 'GitHub repo', track.repo_url})
        %td= category

= button_to "Clear cache", admin_track_categories_path, method: :post, form: { data: { turbo_confirm: "Are you sure? This is an expensive operation" } }, class: 'btn-warning btn-m'
